r.futures.simulation (GRASS GIS addons, OSGeo/grass-addons grass8) with its defects corrected, the
reference for the corrected forms in ls.simulate; installed in WSL as r.futures.simulation_fixed:
  g.extension extension=r.futures.simulation_fixed url=<patched copy>

- after growing a patch, the development pressure of every grown cell is added (the module adds it for
  the first n cells, n = cells inside the seed's subregion);
- get_max_HAND walks the whole bounding box of the catchment (the module walks only its first column);
- the flood probability of a catchment comes from cells that are simulated (the module also reads the
  raw catchment ids of cells left out, which collide with catchment indices).

